### Step 0 — run with VS Code "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request" above each request)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check (public) → 200, status UP, db UP
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### OpenAPI spec (public) → 200, info.title = "Cookify API"
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Any other endpoint requires auth → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/anything
